{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New drama at the Duskheath Museum: 6 months after the death of the curator Ezekiel Dunbridge and the exorcism performed on site, a visitor died yesterday during a nocturnal visit...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You play Esther Mason, the exorcist sent by the Cam-on-Rail company. Your mission: break once and for all the curse that has befallen the place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor the museum throughout the night and neutralize any anomalies or paranormal activity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ERADICATE THE SPIRITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Securely locked behind a 6-lock door, <strong>move your camera along a rail</strong> to monitor every nook and cranny. <strong>Find and photograph anomalies</strong> to exorcise them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/eb45b88c4d05f6ba4baf9fdd21860b77.poster.avif?t=1761243359\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/eb45b88c4d05f6ba4baf9fdd21860b77.webm?t=1761243359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/eb45b88c4d05f6ba4baf9fdd21860b77.mp4?t=1761243359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COURAGE AND PATIENCE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to every detail, and find new anomalies as they occur. After each round, the system reveals the number of anomalies missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each oversight, one of the 6 locks on the seal protecting you is destroyed. To complete your mission, keep at least 1 lock until 8 am and eradicate the evil that haunts this place. <strong>We're counting on you to survive the 8 rounds of the night!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/ed01c5c60b177270a0b60a650de6dc80.poster.avif?t=1761243359\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/ed01c5c60b177270a0b60a650de6dc80.webm?t=1761243359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/ed01c5c60b177270a0b60a650de6dc80.mp4?t=1761243359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DURATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45-200 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Duskheath Museum exhibits collections related to the occult and communication with the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can discover the mysteries of ancient Egypt, pre-Columbian culture, collections of haunted objects, relics related to funeral rites, and many other mysterious artifacts from ancient times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... could it be that your intervention is not limited to exorcising these places?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629290?t=1761243359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/8e29b325de14aff466bbcb2ee383b723eea77db5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761243359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/85a379712ebc6b2092fbd98bce5e4e259c15d490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761243359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/85a379712ebc6b20